      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    remaining_payments = [5000, 5000, 5000]\n    principal = 100000\n    treasury_yield = 0.025\n    spread = 0.012\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    discount_rate = treasury_yield + spread\n    make_whole_call_price = sum(\n        payment / ((1 + discount_rate) ** (year + 1))\n        for year, payment in enumerate(remaining_payments)\n    )\n    make_whole_call_price += principal / ((1 + discount_rate) ** len(remaining_payments))\n\n    answer = round(make_whole_call_price)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
